      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create poll_transcription.py in the current working directory.\nTask: polls a transcription job and returns the transcript.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bb4ea721001IaDleJ2jULY5sy",
