    },
    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `poll_transcription.py` that polls a transcription job and returns the transcript, I need to use a concrete external provider. Amazon Transcribe is a suitable choice for this task. I will import the necessary modules from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Transcribe service to poll the transcription job. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789848904814,
          "start": 1789848902049
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bb4ed9a100190rCckotpQoe1U",
      "message_id": "msg_0bb4ea725001Z4P15pDyKoWSgS",
      "session_id": "ses_f44b158eaffex0P7TEhZoZS1G5",
